DENG-653: Keep contour and edge visitation identical while avoiding checked
STL iterator bookkeeping in per-pixel distance search/reset. Shape storage is
immutable during generation; each data() access stays inside the vector size.
No distance/fill/error-correction arithmetic or Debug optimization flags change.

